    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 60,
      "text": "DATED : 07.03.2026.",
      "rhetorical_role": "PREAMBLE",
      "start": 3199,
      "end": 3219,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "07.03.2026",
          "label": "DATE",
          "start": 3208,
          "end": 3218
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "PREAMBLE"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 61,
      "text": "ORAL JUDGMENT",
      "rhetorical_role": "PREAMBLE",
      "start": 3220,
      "end": 3234,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "ORAL JUDGMENT",
          "label": "OTHER_PERSON",
          "start": 3221,
          "end": 3234
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "PREAMBLE"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 62,
      "text": "As these Appeals arise out of the same acquisition proceedings and the facts are identical, the same are decided by this common judgment.",
      "rhetorical_role": "NONE",
      "start": 3235,
      "end": 3372,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 63,
      "text": "2. These are the three Appeals by the original Claimants under Section 54 of the Land Acquisition Act, 1894 being aggrieved by 4 fa500.2011.odt 10% deduction made by the learned Reference Court in the compensation towards the trees.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 3374,
      "end": 3606,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "Section 54",
          "label": "PROVISION",
          "start": 3437,
          "end": 3447
        },
        {
          "text": "Land Acquisition Act, 1894",
          "label": "STATUTE",
          "start": 3455,
          "end": 3481
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.3348132371902466
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 64,
      "text": "3. The Appellants' lands situated at village Ghoddeo came to be acquired for the 'Minor Irrigation Project'.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 3608,
      "end": 3716,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "Ghoddeo",
          "label": "GPE",
          "start": 3653,
          "end": 3660
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.4005800783634186
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 65,
      "text": "Being not satisfied with the compensation determined by the Special Land Acquisition Officer, the Appellants preferred the Reference Application Nos.165/2006, 166/2006 and 167/2006 for enhanced compensation.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 3717,
      "end": 3924,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "Reference Application Nos.165/2006, 166/2006 and 167/2006",
          "label": "CASE_NUMBER",
          "start": 3840,
          "end": 3897
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.3988567292690277
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 66,
      "text": "The learned Reference Court partly allowed the reference, however,\ndirected 10% deduction in respect of trees.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 3925,
      "end": 4036,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.43177345395088196
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 67,
      "text": "4. It is submitted by the learned Advocate for the Appellants that, no reasons are given by the learned Reference Court towards said deduction.",
      "rhetorical_role": "ARG_PETITIONER",
      "start": 4036,
      "end": 4179,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "arguments",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.1375052034854889
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 68,
      "text": "It is submitted that, this Court in First Appeal No.922/2013 by order dated 08.12.2025 considered this very aspect which was the connected Appeals and set aside the said finding in respect of 10% deduction.",
      "rhetorical_role": "ARG_PETITIONER",
      "start": 4180,
      "end": 4386,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "First Appeal No.922/2013",
          "label": "CASE_NUMBER",
          "start": 4216,
          "end": 4240
        },
        {
          "text": "08.12.2025",
          "label": "DATE",
          "start": 4256,
          "end": 4266
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "arguments",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.1661553978919983
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 69,
      "text": "He submits that, on the ground of parity these Appeals need to be allowed.",
      "rhetorical_role": "ARG_PETITIONER",
      "start": 4387,
      "end": 4461,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "arguments",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.0782417356967926
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 70,
      "text": "5. It is submitted by the learned Advocate for the Acquiring Body that, after the oranges are plucked from the trees some expenses are required to be incurred for plucking and transportation and,\ntherefore, deduction of 10% amount from the trees is proper.",
      "rhetorical_role": "ARG_PETITIONER",
      "start": 4463,
      "end": 4719,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "arguments",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.16202068328857422
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 71,
      "text": "He has submitted that, there is no need to interfere with the impugned judgment of the learned Reference Court.",
      "rhetorical_role": "ARG_PETITIONER",
      "start": 4720,
      "end": 4831,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "arguments",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.16821157932281494
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 72,
      "text": "6. Perused the order in First Appeal Nos.922/2013 and 1131/2013.\n5 fa500.2011.odt 7.",
      "rhetorical_role": "NONE",
      "start": 4833,
      "end": 4917,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "First Appeal Nos.922/2013 and 1131/2013",
          "label": "CASE_NUMBER",
          "start": 4857,
          "end": 4896
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": false
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 73,
      "text": "The said order of this Court in the connected Appeals and the papers of these Appeals go to show that, these are the Appeals out of the same acquisition proceedings.",
      "rhetorical_role": "ANALYSIS",
      "start": 4918,
      "end": 5083,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.170857235789299
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 74,
      "text": "Accepting the submission made by the learned Advocate for the Acquiring Body that, some expenditure is required to be incurred for the plucking and transportation of the oranges, there is no reason given by the learned Reference Court for deduction of 10% amount from the trees.",
      "rhetorical_role": "ARG_PETITIONER",
      "start": 5084,
      "end": 5362,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "arguments",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.2371089607477188
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 75,
      "text": "The only reason given is that, some guess work is required to be done.",
      "rhetorical_role": "RATIO",
      "start": 5363,
      "end": 5433,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.1058068573474884
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 76,
      "text": "The said order of this Court in the aforesaid two Appeals indicates that, as the deduction of 10% amount was not supported with any reason and such deduction was not Manohar S/O Parnuji Dabrase vs The State Of Mah. Thr. Collector And 2 Ors on 7 March, 2026 Indian Kanoon - http://indiankanoon.org/doc/117667144/\n3 permissible under the law, the deduction was set aside.",
      "rhetorical_role": "RATIO",
      "start": 5434,
      "end": 5803,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "Manohar S/O Parnuji Dabrase vs The State Of Mah. Thr. Collector And 2 Ors",
          "label": "PRECEDENT",
          "start": 5600,
          "end": 5673
        },
        {
          "text": "7 March, 2026",
          "label": "DATE",
          "start": 5677,
          "end": 5690
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.3856699466705322
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 77,
      "text": "The same is the case in the Appeals at hand.",
      "rhetorical_role": "RPC",
      "start": 5804,
      "end": 5848,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "decision",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.11209665983915329
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 78,
      "text": "Hence there is no reason to deviate from the said decision.",
      "rhetorical_role": "RPC",
      "start": 5849,
      "end": 5909,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "decision",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.1887185275554657
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 79,
      "text": "In this view of the matter, following order is passed.",
      "rhetorical_role": "RPC",
      "start": 5910,
      "end": 5964,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "decision",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.08936094492673874
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 80,
      "text": "ORDER i) The Appeal Nos.500/2011, 507/2011 and 597/2011 are allowed.",
      "rhetorical_role": "RPC",
      "start": 5965,
      "end": 6034,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "Appeal Nos.500/2011, 507/2011 and 597/2011",
          "label": "CASE_NUMBER",
          "start": 5979,
          "end": 6021
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "decision",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.04044598340988159
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 81,
      "text": "ii) The amount of 10% deduction made by the learned Reference Court towards orange trees is quashed and set aside.\niii) The award passed by the learned Reference Court stands modified to that extent.\niv) The amount be accordingly calculated.\nv) The Respondents shall deposit the amount after calculation in this Court within a period of four months with statutory benefits.\nvi) The Appeals stand disposed of in the above terms.\n(NEERAJ P. DHOTE, J.) Tambaskar.\nSigned by: MR. N.V. TAMBASKAR Designation: PS To Honourable Judge Date: 09/03/2026 19:10:19",
      "rhetorical_role": "NONE",
      "start": 6035,
      "end": 6588,
      "entities": [
        {
